cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release and the associated research article when available."
title: "Microbial Epoxide Hydrolase Discovery Pipeline"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Rodrigues"
    given-names: "Wellington Francisco"
  - family-names: "Kiss"
    given-names: "Sophie"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational pipeline for genome mining, sequence-based
  prioritization, phylogenetic analysis, motif and Pfam annotation,
  genomic-context analysis, structural modeling, binding-pocket prediction,
  and exploratory molecular docking of microbial epoxide hydrolase-like proteins.
keywords:
  - epoxide hydrolase
  - alpha/beta hydrolase
  - genome mining
  - bioinformatics
  - comparative genomics
  - protein structure
  - molecular docking
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/WFR2023/microbial-epoxide-hydrolase-discovery-pipeline"
